<title>GREECE: GREEK 95 DOMESTIC BORROWING OVERSHOOTING AMOUNTED TO 6.7TRL DRS.</title>
<headline>GREEK 95 DOMESTIC BORROWING OVERSHOOTING AMOUNTED TO 6.7TRL DRS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state council said that domestic state borrowing amounted to 11 trillion drachmas in 1995 versus 4.2 trillion drachmas forecast by the government, conservative New Democracy party leader Miltiadis Evert told parliament. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
